Recommends: flatpak, docker.io | docker-ce
Suggests: baobab
Description: safe disk-space cleaner for Ubuntu 22.04 (GTK4/libadwaita)
 Headroom scans editor, Electron and browser caches, developer package
 caches, logs, old snap revisions, Docker leftovers, the Trash and large
 files, shows the real on-disk size of each item, previews exactly what will
 be removed and cleans only what you select. Root-only actions run through a
 small polkit helper that accepts only a fixed list of action IDs.
